### 7. 🟡 Frontend — [index.html](file:///d:/MarketMinds/marketminds-chatbot/frontend/index.html) + [app.js](file:///d:/MarketMinds/marketminds-chatbot/frontend/app.js) + [style.css](file:///d:/MarketMinds/marketminds-chatbot/frontend/style.css) (BASIC)

| Current | Problem |
|---------|---------|
| No loading indicator | User doesn't know if request is processing |
| No markdown rendering in bot responses | LLM output (with `**bold**`, lists, etc.) shows as raw text |
| No chat history persistence | Refresh = everything gone |
| No mobile responsiveness metadata | Missing `<meta name="viewport">` |
| No document upload UI | Users can't add documents through the interface |
| No suggested questions / onboarding | Empty chat with no guidance |

#### ✅ How to Make Dynamic

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| **Loading spinner** | Show animated dots/spinner while `fetch()` is pending |
| **Markdown rendering** | Use [marked.js](https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/marked/marked.min.js) to render bot responses |
| **Chat persistence** | Use `localStorage` to save/restore conversation |
| **File upload** | Add drag-and-drop or file picker that POSTs to `/upload` |
| **Suggested prompts** | Show clickable example questions on first load |
| **Dark/Light theme toggle** | Already dark-themed; add toggle for accessibility |
| **Typing animation** | Stream-in bot responses character-by-character |

