### 9. 🟡 Configuration — [config.py](file:///d:/MarketMinds/marketminds-chatbot/backend/app/config.py)

| Current | Problem |
|---------|---------|
| `DEBUG = True` hardcoded | Should read from env |
| No [.env](file:///d:/MarketMinds/.env) file loading in the config module | Relies on OS-level env vars only |
| `DEFAULT_MODEL_NAME` not used by [main.py](file:///d:/MarketMinds/marketminds-chatbot/backend/app/main.py) | [main.py](file:///d:/MarketMinds/marketminds-chatbot/backend/app/main.py) hardcodes `"mistral"` independently |

#### ✅ Fix

```python
from dotenv import load_dotenv
load_dotenv()

class AppConfig:
    DEBUG: bool = os.getenv("DEBUG", "false").lower() == "true"
    DEFAULT_MODEL_NAME: str = os.getenv("DEFAULT_MODEL", "mistral")
    # ... use these in main.py instead of hardcoded values
```

