> [!TIP]
> **Recommended starting point:** Tackle **Phase 1** first (items 1-5). These are all low-effort fixes that will make the RAG pipeline actually work. The single biggest impact change is replacing [DummyEmbeddingClient](file:///d:/MarketMinds/marketminds-chatbot/backend/app/rag/embeddings.py#30-44) — it transforms the chatbot from returning random text chunks to returning semantically relevant context.
